(7474885, 1187511, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow that looks a very interesting tipple. One for a special occasion like winning a ribbon. Congrats!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I quit booze, otherwise would have been empty... and the snake eaten LOL  <br/> <br/>I did drink before though: snake, bees, lizard, termites. The more you drink the less you care<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Wow that looks a very interesting tipple. One for a special occasion like winning a ribbon. Congrats!!   I quit booze, otherwise would have been empty... and the snake eaten LOL   I did drink before though: snake, bees, lizard, termites. The more you drink the less you care Thanks!', '2016-09-21 05:30:31.000000', NULL, 0),
